  subtitle: {fileID: 164134628}
  lines:
  - If somebody hears this.
  - She is coming up the attic stairs.
  - I can hear the brass bell.
  - She puts the bulbs out, one by one.
  - Don't let them all go out.
  - Pull the strings. Pull the strings!
